      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُفْلَةٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَفْلَةٌ</span></b>  (TA [there said in
one place to be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بالفتح</span>, but this is most probably
a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بالضمّ</span>,]) <i>A fleece</i> of wool:
(S, K) [a word used in the sense of ] a pass.
part. n., like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُرْفَة</span> in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِغْتَرَفَ غُرْفَةً</span>. (S.)

